= functor.systems

Also available under the "Members" section of the #link("https://functor.systems/#:~:text=Members,-User")[main site].

- #link("https://web.youwen.dev/")[Youwen Wu]

  - Benevolent dictator for life (BDFL) of #link("https://functor.systems/")[functor.systems]; recently tired of studying computer science and now devotes his time to an exploration of pure mathematics #link("https://ccs.ucsb.edu/")[in paradise]. While at #link("https://www.team1280.com/")[Team 1280], we worked on #link("https://eexiv.functor.systems/")[eeXiv] together, now maintained under the auspices of #link("https://functor.systems/")[functor.systems].

- #link("https://web.kaitotlex.systems/")[Warren Lin]

  - Head of electrical engineering and most talented hacker at #link("https://functor.systems/")[functor.systems]\; he #link("/colophon#financial-disclosures")[bankrolls my website] and indirectly maintains most of my physical infrastructure through regular repairs so I can spend more time theorizing.

- #link("https://github.com/anthonysdone")[Anthony Donegan]

  - The only other electrical engineer at #link("https://functor.systems/")[functor.systems]; he developed a #link("https://forgejo.mit.edu/OCL/BurningBush")[neural network entirely in HolyC] and runs the startup incubator λ-combinator at MIT

