  - Hacker by day, musician by night; ponders a wide variety of philosophical questions relating to #link("https://pdodds.w3.uvm.edu/teaching/courses/2009-08UVM-300/docs/others/2003/abrams2003.pdf")[linguistic shift], #link("https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-3-319-64364-9")[transformational music theory], and embodied robotic systems.

