  - Theoretical computer scientist and Vulkan graphics expert; he served as head of #link("https://eexiv.functor.systems/author/nluo")[controls architecture] over at #link("https://www.team1280.com/")[Team 1280] immediately after I left the team, during which time he brought many bleeding edge research projects to fruition.

