  - Former head of #link("https://sipb.mit.edu/")[SIPB], #link("https://asa.mit.edu/")[MIT ASA] (that's the club that runs all other clubs) executive, and photographer for #link("https://thetech.com/")[The Tech]; I'm clearly missing a dozen other affiliations, but I would be remiss not to mention that he is #link("https://functor.systems/#:~:text=forklift%20certified")[forklift certified].
